  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "超大型積體電路設計導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO VLSI CIRCUIT DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "這門課將介紹超大型積體電路(VLSI)基本的元件特性、元件製程與電路設計原理，將涵蓋下列五項內容：1. CMOS元件基礎物理知識、2. VLSI電路組成原理、3. VLSI電路物理結構、4. VLSI電路系統設計與分析與5.VLSI實作設計簡介。\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce the basic characteristics and component manufacturing process of devices, and circuit design principles of very large integrated circuits (VLSI). It will include basic physics of CMOS components,  composition principles of VLSI, physical structure designing of VLSI, system design and analysis of VLSI, and introduce the implementation of VLSI.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解VLSI電路的應用。",
      "describe_en": "The application of VLSI circuit。"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "VLSI電路設計的知識。",
      "describe_en": "The knowledge of VLSI circuit。"
    }
